    `a claim` (YMD 2026 6 15) TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 7 1)) NOTHING FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 9 1)) (JUST (YMD 2026 12 1)) NOTHING NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
