#ASSERT `General Condition 4(b): all benefit is forfeited, as at` (YMD 2027 1 11) `, for` `a claim rejected, arbitrated, award 10 October 2026`

§§ `General Condition 7 — the arbitration clocks`

-- Request made 31 July 2026, received 10 August. Two calendar months from the request end on
-- 30 September (no 31 September: add months clamps). Two from receipt end on 10 October, so a
-- sole arbitrator may be appointed from 11 October. Late, but without remedy: 1 to 10
-- October, ten days (finding 4).
#ASSERT `General Condition 7: the last day to appoint an arbitrator, after a written request made on` (YMD 2026 7 31) EQUALS YMD 2026 9 30
#ASSERT `General Condition 7: the first day a sole arbitrator may be appointed, after a written request received on` (YMD 2026 8 10) EQUALS YMD 2026 10 11
#ASSERT `General Condition 7: the days on which the party asked is late but no sole arbitrator may yet be appointed, for a request made on` (YMD 2026 7 31) `and received on` (YMD 2026 8 10) EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `General Condition 7: the days on which the party asked is late but no sole arbitrator may yet be appointed, for a request made on` (YMD 2026 7 31) `and received on` (YMD 2026 7 31) EQUALS 0

