#ASSERT `General Condition 11: the most the Insurer need spend reinstating, where reinstating as at the time of the loss would cost` 2_300_000_000 `and the sum insured is` 2_000_000_000 EQUALS 2_000_000_000
#ASSERT `General Condition 11: what the Insurer pays where regulations prevent reinstatement, the lawful-reinstatement cost being` 300_000_000 EQUALS 300_000_000

§§ `General Condition 12 — the twelve months`

-- Loss 15 June 2026: liability ends after 15 June 2027 unless the claim is then pending or in
-- arbitration. Not pending (rejected 1 September 2026, never sued): liable on 15 June 2027,
-- not on 16 June. Pending (made, never rejected): still liable later.
#ASSERT `General Condition 12: the last day of the twelve months after a loss on` (YMD 2026 6 15) EQUALS YMD 2027 6 15
#ASSERT `General Condition 12: the Insurer can still be liable, as at` (YMD 2027 6 15) `, for a loss on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `under` `a claim rejected on 1 September 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `General Condition 12: the Insurer can still be liable, as at` (YMD 2027 6 16) `, for a loss on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `under` `a claim rejected on 1 September 2026`
#ASSERT `General Condition 12: the Insurer can still be liable, as at` (YMD 2027 9 1) `, for a loss on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `under` `the proper claim`
#ASSERT `General Condition 12: the Insurer can still be liable, as at` (YMD 2027 9 1) `, for a loss on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `under` `a claim rejected on 1 September 2026, sued on 1 December`
