-- In arbitration with no award by 15 June 2027: still liable.
#ASSERT `General Condition 12: the Insurer can still be liable, as at` (YMD 2027 9 1) `, for a loss on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `under` (`a claim` (YMD 2026 6 15) TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 7 1)) NOTHING FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 9 1)) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 9 5)) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

